            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "5c3a9137-3900-4154-a1d3-5812748201e5",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "1dacd813-0746-46e7-a4ed-da5a6f73c691",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Slush: My father\nran the east\ngreenhouse. One\nfrozen reply wire,\none unopened",
                      "valve, and a\nseason of\nseedlings lost.\nThe city sent\ncondolences",
                      "printed on very\nwarm paper. I\nbought the lodge",
                      "to stop waiting\nfor permission to\nkeep people safe."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ee808d47-92dd-4f53-acfb-b32a49a2c270",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "612bf4a0-86a1-433f-ad71-cdd80d9fd242",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "af55460f-367b-4205-a0b3-a43cd490e4f1",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "58dc48df-b1d4-4d3e-ae56-9bcb13edb088",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "206a3736-a875-42c3-a4c5-10fd507b3833",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The review file\nhas four fields:\nrepair amount,\nwork date, tenant\nname, and medical",
                      "note. The public\nfund needs the\namount and work\ndate to verify the\nrepair. Neither a",
                      "tenant name nor a\nmedical note is\nneeded for that\ncheck. Slush fears\nthe review will",
                      "make his residents\ninto exhibits. Dot\nsays\naccountability for\nmoney does not",
                      "require exposing\ndetails that\ncannot prove how a\nroof was repaired."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "6a02eac4-b429-4568-a013-f090a9793562",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c411dbff-6629-4f71-ab3b-8ef2b38a029d",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "d84786c2-63ef-4344-a92c-56bee96fd150",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "f69bac05-57ac-4141-a201-b08f82b300b2",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "e60d05d6-630f-4986-a3a6-074e9edb2d69",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The survey lists\nactual repair\ncosts, loans, and\ntenants who paid\nnothing during the",
                      "freeze. Beside\nthem is a future\nrent plan for the\nsealed district.\nIt would fund",
                      "maintenance, but\nhalf the current\nresidents could\nnot afford to\nremain."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "425d8c52-0ec3-4394-a456-81996d83de78",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "654fb0ba-2343-4554-aad9-1cdb9ac9bdc0",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "63f82600-042f-44ff-a88d-beb4dd37a72c",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "29232012-840c-404b-a5cf-e726681b7709",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "31e9864d-23be-45b9-acac-77feacc8c553",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Slush offers the\nfull inspection\nfile. You may\nREVIEW it together\nat his desk or",
                      "request a PUBLIC\nreview with the\nclerk. Both\npreserve his\nprivate tenant",
                      "names. Choose the\ntrust process for\nthe negotiation."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d177c5bf-2488-4241-a929-3fc6c0b73132",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "801cb337-057b-4ba8-a515-22c69e25ce41",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "be8e3c27-fd2f-4e18-a594-8c66d3f59806",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "4de7acd2-b544-4780-a86b-4c36ff0401fc",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "65cbe45f-1c4b-4a06-abdf-07b3af2daa4b",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Choose the public\nreview copy: ALL\nincludes every\nfield; COSTS\nincludes repair",
                      "amount AND work\ndate; NAMES\nincludes tenant\nidentities only.\nWhich copy",
                      "verifies the\nrepair without\nexposing unrelated\nprivate details?\nNib will compare",
                      "it with the\noriginal before\nposting. Slush\nwaits without\nsuggesting that",
                      "privacy should\nexcuse hiding the\nprice of the work.",
                      "The same standard\napplies to either\nreview process."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "aca8acc1-9750-4c50-a369-4c4ac7d3d149",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
